    "Liquid Glass uses the macOS 26 glass effect. Frosted uses a blur material. Solid uses a full opacity color. Clear removes the background entirely." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control description",
      "extractionState" : "stale",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
