            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "nl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Druk op de 'Dock bewerken' sneltoets om het Dock te bewerken. Sleep apps, mappen, bestanden, URL’s of geopende apps naar het Dock om ze in het actieve profiel vast te zetten. Houd in de bewerkingsmodus een vastgezet pictogram ingedrukt om de volgorde te wijzigen en klik vervolgens op het vinkje als je klaar bent."
          }
        },
        "pl" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Naciśnij skrót Edytuj dock, aby przejść do edycji. Przeciągnij aplikacje, foldery, pliki, adresy URL lub uruchomione aplikacje na dock, aby przypiąć je do aktywnego profilu. W trybie edycji przytrzymaj dłuższą chwilę przypiętą ikonę, aby zmienić jej kolejność, a po zakończeniu kliknij ikonę wyboru."
          }
        },
        "pt" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "pt-BR" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "ro" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "ru" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Нажмите ярлык на кнопку Edit Dock для редактирования дока. Перетащите приложения, папки, файлы, URL-адреса или запущенные приложения на док-станцию для прикрепления их к активному профилю. В режиме редактирования, удерживайте закрепленный значок, чтобы упорядочить его, затем нажмите на галочку по завершении."
          }
        },
        "sr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "tr" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Dock’u düzenlemek için “Dock’u Düzenle” kısayoluna basın. Dock’a uygulama, klasör, dosya, URL veya açık uygulamaları sürükleyerek aktif profile sabitleyin. Düzenleme modunda sabitlenmiş bir simgeye uzun basarak sırasını değiştirin, ardından bitirdiğinizde onay işaretine tıklayın."
          }
        },
        "uk" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "vi" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "Press your Edit Dock shortcut to edit the dock. Drag apps, folders, files, URLs, or running apps onto the dock to pin them to the active profile. In edit mode, long-press a pinned icon to reorder it, then click the checkmark when finished."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按下“编辑 Dock”快捷键以编辑 Dock。将应用、文件夹、文件、URL 或正在运行的应用拖放到 Dock 上，即可将其固定到当前活动配置。在编辑模式下，长按已固定图标可重新排序；完成后点击对勾按钮。"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "按下「編輯 Dock」快速鍵即可編輯 Dock。將應用程式、檔案夾、檔案、網址或執行中的應用程式拖曳到 Dock，即可將其釘選至目前設定檔。在編輯模式下，長按已釘選的圖示可調整順序；完成後按一下勾選按鈕即可。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
