    "To show Quick Actions on the dock: go to Widget Stacks, add a stack, then add the Quick Actions widget to it. Configure which actions are pinned below. Long-press the widget to open the full Control Center drawer." : {
      "comment" : "Settings control title",
      "localizations" : {
        "af" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "To show Quick Actions on the dock: go to Widget Stacks, add a stack, then add the Quick Actions widget to it. Configure which actions are pinned below. Long-press the widget to open the full Control Center drawer."
          }
        },
        "ar" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
